{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310408001:1":{"text":"드디어 오셨네요. 저, 여러분의 친구 로잔이 여기서 혼자 외롭게 한참 동안 기다리고 있었다고요!","source_cn":"你们可算到了。我，你们忠诚的朋友洛桑，在这里孤苦伶仃地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAB88E6B3134EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310408002:0":{"text":"너무 오버하시는 거 아니에요! 그러다간 파트너를 찾지 못할 거예요!","source_cn":"表演太浮夸了！你这样的表现，会邀请不到舞伴的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D9B65AC4CB9BFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310408003:0":{"text":"이렇게 즐거운 무도회에 적당한 과장이야말로 즐거움의 정수죠.","source_cn":"那你可就错了，这样欢乐的舞会，适当的夸张才是令人开心的精髓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA8DE3A976D8CA9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310408004:0":{"text":"게다가 얼마나 과장된 표현을 하든, 무도회의 화제는 제가 아닐 거예요.","source_cn":"而且无论怎样夸张，舞会的焦点也不会是我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F504E89A27B69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310408005:0":{"text":"공주님께서 행운아 한 명을 초대해 가면무도회의 첫 번째 춤을 출 거라고 하셨거든요. 그 사람이야말로 진정한 화제의 인물이 될 거예요!","source_cn":"听说公主殿下会邀请一位幸运儿来一起为化装舞会开舞，那位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75CB6E09D10B9FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310408006:0":{"text":"어쩌면... 그게 정말 로잔 씨일지도 모르잖아요?","source_cn":"说不定……真的会是你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB192C369A156E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310408007:0":{"text":"하하, 치피 말이 맞았으면 좋겠네요. 저렇게 귀여운 공주님과 춤을 출 수 있다면 소원이 없겠어요!","source_cn":"哈，承你吉言。和这样一位可爱的小公主跳舞，如果真的是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA14167327339B2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}